  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhangwei-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangwei-complete:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAB">偉</persName>少有操行，為晉琅邪王國郎中令，從王至洛，還京都，武帝封藥酒一甖付<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangwei-complete:p001:m0033" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAB">偉</persName>，令密加鴆毒，受命於道自飲而卒。</p>
